              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Beverly McNulty"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been using the broiler for years to blister my peppers. The oven method much easier. After cooking I marinate peppers with salt, pepper , garlic and olive oil. As usual very good. Thanks for the tip on using the oven for roasting.",
            "datePublished": "2017-03-14T17:43:07.680Z"
          },
