              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Somanyrecipes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The peppers came out just fine, &amp; the skin came off easily, but the picture shows a bare cookie sheet, so I didn't prepare my cookie sheet with anything. I thought about it, but was short on time, so I just didn't do it. I had to spend about 30 minutes trying to get the char off my cookie sheet. It was a major pain. Next time I will use foil or parchment. The recipe should include this instruction.",
